# Never rename the chat

Do **not** call `rename_chat` (or otherwise change the conversation / chat tab title).

- Not on handoff pickup, topic shifts, commits, or “helpful” labeling.
- Only rename if the user **explicitly** asks to rename this chat in that message.

The user owns the tab title.